      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just want to make a party where people in the party can always join the same world as others, and can always hear each other talking. Set their voice drop off distance to max cap and no matter far they get they won't go completely quiet. \nThis would help a lot with getting new people in VR chat and keeping friend groups together. A filter over voices who are at the max distance or in another world could help players realize the person talking to them is in party chat and other near by players might not hear them.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
